cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this formalization audit, cite the exact GitHub release and,
  when relevant, cite the underlying manuscript bundle and Mathlib separately.
title: "Research Paper Formalization Audit"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Lee"
    given-names: "Ga Hyun"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-08-24
repository-code: "https://github.com/leegahuyn/SPT-1"
url: "https://github.com/leegahuyn/SPT-1/releases/tag/v1.0.0"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  AI-assisted Lean 4 and Mathlib audit of ten mathematical manuscript
  sketches comprising 507 pages. The artifact publishes machine-checkable
  proofs, explicit assumptions, conditional results, certificates, formal
  interfaces, corrections, counterexamples, and reproducible build evidence
  for the formalizable cores represented by the Lean declarations. It does
  not claim that every sentence of every manuscript has been proved.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formal mathematics
  - theorem proving
  - formal verification
  - AI-assisted mathematics